## Third-Party Services

This project uses the following third-party services:

### pollinations.ai
- **Purpose:** AI image generation for bouquet previews
- **Website:** https://pollinations.ai
- **Usage:** The pollinations.ai API is used to generate photorealistic bouquet images based on user selections
- **License:** Please refer to pollinations.ai's terms of service
- **Attribution Required:** Yes - This project includes proper attribution in the footer and README

### Supabase
- **Purpose:** Backend database and file storage
- **Website:** https://supabase.com
- **License:** Please refer to Supabase's terms of service
